  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Troy E. Meink described autonomy as one of the key technologies enabling cost-effective combat power. He said the workforce must grow to take full advantage of AI, machine learning, and automation required to deliver capability to users. He also called the technology “a little bit scary” but said, “we need to lean into it.”",
